d mode with the right timing if the `Input.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED` was called when the game did not have the focus.\r\n\r\nThere was an issue with the new `--hidden` because the game process was still focused/activated even if it was hidden.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661763672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662859142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102921#issuecomment-2662859142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102921","id":2662859142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6euAGG","user":{"login":"giokhmaladze","id":7861548,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NjE1NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7861548?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze","html_url":"https://github.com/giokhmaladze","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/giokhmaladze/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T11:37:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T11:37:25Z","body":"gave it another try, mouse pointer isn't locked in editor anymore (when bottom panel is expanded)